"""verify-architecture — production architecture enforcement for Infynitae Native (OB-19).

Ported from experiments/c1-authority-spike/verify.sh to the production workspace. Headless,
non-interactive and deterministic. Exit status 0 only when every mandatory check passes.

Checks:
  [1] pins: rust-toolchain.toml, active compiler, Cargo.lock, Smithay =0.7.0 (INV-ARCH-3)
  [2] dependency DAG (INV-ARCH-1, C1.3, C7.1)
  [3] probe-feature hygiene
  [4] structural source rules (2g, 2h, mint location, wayland names, unsafe policy)
  [5] negative compile probes with asserted diagnostics, positive controls
  [6] seeded negative controls: the checks above must detect injected defects
  [7] deferred runtime validation (reported, never counted as tested)

Usage: tools/verify-architecture [--skip-mutations]
"""

